---
import SiteLayout from '../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const href = (value: string) => `${base.replace(/\/?$/, '/')}${value.replace(/^\/+/, '')}`;
const flow = 'Sandbox platform\n' +
  '├── ConnectionAgent Domain  ·  Agent / Runtime / Skills\n' +
  '├── Tool Plane              ·  discovery / gateway / common capabilities\n' +
  '├── Environment Plane       ·  environment substrate / simulated & real worlds / env-fabric\n' +
  '├── Evaluation              ·  Benchmark assets / evaluation engine\n' +
  '├── Control / Surface       ·  experiment control / console\n' +
  '└── Shared Foundation       ·  nodus\n' +
  '\nPlatform-level composition and compatibility governance.\n' +
  'Each component retains its own contract and fact authority.';
---
<SiteLayout title="Sandbox 总体架构" lang="zh" description="Sandbox 平台分层、主要阅读路径和技术文档权威边界。">
  <section class="home-hero">
    <span class="eyebrow">Sandbox / Architecture</span>
    <h1>Sandbox 总体架构</h1>
    <p>Sandbox 将 Agent、工具、环境、实验控制和评估组件组合为可重复运行的系统。本页提供平台级地图和阅读入口；组件职责、技术流程及当前状态以源仓维护的详细文档和验收证据为准。</p>
    <div class="home-actions">
      <a href={href('/components/sandbox/#platform-architecture')}>详细架构与职责边界 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      <a href={href('/runbooks/real-5gc/')}>真实 5GC 运行手册 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      <a href={href('/interfaces/real-5gc-evidence/')}>接口与证据 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      <a href={href('/benchmark/')}>Benchmark 评估框架 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="home-section">
    <h2>平台分层</h2>
    <p>以下是目标职责分类，用于理解各类组件如何组合；它不是已完成迁移或端到端验收的清单。</p>
    <pre><code>{flow}</code></pre>
    <p>物理仓名与目标分类可能暂时不同。具体组件的实现、契约和事实由相应 owner 仓库维护，平台文档负责说明它们如何协作。</p>
  </section>

  <section class="home-section">
    <h2>按问题阅读</h2>
    <div class="reading-list">
      <a class="reading-item" href={href('/components/sandbox/#platform-architecture')}>
        <span class="reading-number">01</span>
        <span><strong>组件怎样协作，事实由谁负责？</strong><small>源仓维护的平台架构、组件职责、权威边界，以及真实 5GC 的 R1 / R2-B 流程。</small></span>
        <span class="reading-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </a>
      <a class="reading-item" href={href('/runbooks/real-5gc/')}>
        <span class="reading-number">02</span>
        <span><strong>如何启动并验收真实 5GC？</strong><small>按运行步骤检查组网、会话、PFCP、用户面连通性和对应证据。</small></span>
        <span class="reading-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </a>
      <a class="reading-item" href={href('/interfaces/real-5gc-evidence/')}>
        <span class="reading-number">03</span>
        <span><strong>哪些接口和证据可以证明结果？</strong><small>查看请求/响应契约、事实来源、证据关联范围与独立判定边界。</small></span>
        <span class="reading-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </a>
      <a class="reading-item" href={href('/benchmark/')}>
        <span class="reading-number">04</span>
        <span><strong>如何评估 Agent 的可靠性？</strong><small>从平台级评估地图进入资产、执行生命周期和结果判定的 owner 文档。</small></span>
        <span class="reading-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="home-section">
    <h2>状态如何解读</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>目标架构</strong>说明组件的预期职责和组合关系，不代表所有目标组件都已落地。</li>
      <li><strong>源仓实现</strong>以组件 owner 仓库中有版本依据的文档、代码和契约为准。</li>
      <li><strong>验收状态</strong>以对应测试和证据为准；文档同步、代码合并或静态站构建成功都不等同于端到端验收。</li>
    </ul>
    <p>详细技术说明及 R1 / R2-B 的当前状态请阅读<a href={href('/components/sandbox/#platform-architecture')}>源仓架构文档</a>与<a href={href('/runbooks/real-5gc/')}>运行手册</a>，不要从目标名称推断交付状态。</p>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
